{%- comment -%}
  Default Legal Notice (design: Legal.dc), rendered by
  snippets/somna-policy-doc.liquid while the page body is empty.
  part: 'toc' (On this page links) or 'body'.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if part == 'toc' -%}
  <a href="#company">1. Company details</a>
  <a href="#ip">2. Trademarks &amp; copyright</a>
  <a href="#content">3. Website content</a>
  <a href="#links">4. External links</a>
  <a href="#safety">5. Product safety</a>
  <a href="#disputes">6. Consumer disputes</a>
  <a href="#credits">7. Credits</a>
{%- else -%}
  {%- capture terms_url -%}{%- render 'somna-policy-url', handle: 'terms-of-service' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
  <h2 id="company">1. Company Details</h2>
  <div class="s-table-box">
    <table class="s-pol-table s-pol-table--lg s-pol-table--rows" style="min-width: 440px;">
      <tbody>
        <tr><th scope="row">Legal name</th><td>[{AppName} legal entity name], trading as {AppName}</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">Registered address</th><td>[Street address], [City, State ZIP], [Country]</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">Company registration</th><td>[Registration number], [Registry / State of incorporation]</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">Tax / VAT ID</th><td>[EIN, VAT or GST number]</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">Managing director(s)</th><td>[Name(s)]</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">Email</th><td><a href="mailto:legal@[yourdomain].com">legal@[yourdomain].com</a></td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">Website hosting</th><td>Shopify Inc., [confirm Shopify's current registered address]</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 id="ip">2. Trademarks &amp; Copyright</h2>
  <p>{AppName}, the {AppName} logo and our product names are trademarks of [{AppName} legal entity name] [registered or pending in Country]. All text, photos, videos and graphics on this site belong to us or our licensors and may not be copied, reproduced or used without written permission, except for sharing links or personal, non-commercial use.</p>

  <h2 id="content">3. Website Content</h2>
  <p>We work to keep everything on this site accurate and current, but we can't guarantee it's complete or free of errors. Product information is for general guidance and isn't medical advice. See our <a href="{{ terms_url }}">Terms of Service</a> for the full terms of use.</p>

  <h2 id="links">4. External Links</h2>
  <p>Our site may link to websites run by others, such as press coverage, social media or payment providers. We don't control those sites and aren't responsible for their content. If you find a link to unlawful content, let us know and we'll remove it.</p>

  <h2 id="safety">5. Product Safety</h2>
  <p>Manufacturer: [Manufacturer name and address]. [For EU sales: EU responsible person, name, address and email.] To report a product safety concern, email <a href="mailto:safety@[yourdomain].com">safety@[yourdomain].com</a>.</p>

  <h2 id="disputes">6. Consumer Disputes</h2>
  <p>If you have a complaint, please contact us first. We'll do our best to resolve it quickly. [State whether you participate in any consumer dispute resolution scheme, and name it if required in your market.] Our <a href="{{ terms_url }}">Terms of Service</a> explain how other disputes are handled.</p>

  <h2 id="credits">7. Credits</h2>
  <p>Photography: [Photographer or studio]. Website design and development: [Agency or team].</p>
{%- endif -%}
